  "solution": {
    "text": "<math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>Z</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>Z</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>Z</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>Z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>ϕ</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>ϕ</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>ϕ</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>ϕ</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>ϕ</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>ϕ</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mfrac><mrow><mi>ϕ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mfrac><mrow><mi>ϕ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mfrac><mrow><mi>ϕ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mfrac><mrow><mi>ϕ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>ϕ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>ϕ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mfrac><mi>ϕ</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>ϕ</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>π</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>ϕ</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">π</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math><br />Now,&nbsp;<math><mn>3</mn><mi>ϕ</mi><mo>∈</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>π</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>⇒</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>ϕ</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>π</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>∈</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>π</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br />But, the argument lies in <math><mfenced close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>π</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>π</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>, hence<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>arg</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi>Z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>Z</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>ϕ</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>π</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>ϕ</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>π</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>"
